  "answer": "This feature request has been filed before. PowerToys#11655 (Rename Presets/Profiles) is the original tracking issue. PowerToys#12686 (Favorites/Bookmarks), PowerToys#34287 and others were closed as duplicates of it. They ask for the same thing: saving a named set of search and replace patterns plus option checkboxes, and recalling it later. This isn't implemented yet. Subscribe to PowerToys#11655 and add your use case there. Until it ships, PowerRename keeps only a history dropdown of recent search and replace expressions. That history gets overwritten as you use it, so keep your complex regexes in an external notes file for now."
